    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Trigger</strong> You are about to cast a spell using focus points, or cast a focus spell.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Requirements</strong> You are within 30 feet of a natural object or terrain that could provide the aspected energy or element for your triggering spell.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per hour</p><hr></div><p>Improvising on the fly, you can use natural items or nearby terrain as a source of ether. You use the required object or terrain to negate one point of the focus point cost of the triggering spell.</p>"
